<title>USA: Dade Cty, Fla., $440 mln deal repriced, yields cut.</title>
<headline>Dade Cty, Fla., $440 mln deal repriced, yields cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc said Thursday it repriced and restructured Dade County, Fla.'s $440.1 million water and sewer bond deal, lowering the top yield in 2026 to 5.70 percent from 5.734 percent.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
<p>DADE COUNTY, FLORIDA</p>
<p>RE: $440,120,000*</p>
<p>WATER AND SEWER SYSTEM REVENUE BONDS</p>
<p>SERIES 1997</p>
<p>THIS ISSUE WILL BE IN BOOK ENTRY FORM THROUGH THE FACILITIES</p>
<p>OF DTC</p>
<p>PLEASE NOTE REPRICING AND RESTRUCTURING.</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>MOODY'S: Aaa(FGIC INS) S&amp;P: AAA(FGIC INS) FITCH: AAA(FGIC INS)</p>
<p>UNDERLYING: A	    UNDERLYING: A	UNDERLYING: A</p>
